Modified ecores and models will be saved in "modified",
possibly in subdirectories (see the main files and tests)

To build and test the examples from the repository root, reusing existing
Xtext and Xtend generated sources while compiling the Edelta files:

./mvnw -B -f edelta.parent/pom.xml verify -pl :edelta.examples -am \
  -DskipMWE2 -DskipXtend \
  -Dtycho.localArtifacts=ignore -Djgit.dirtyWorkingTree=ignore

Omit -DskipMWE2 and -DskipXtend when generated sources are not current.

For the live in-memory model previews, see LIVE-MODEL-PREVIEW.md.
